# Competing lockfiles.
#
# Vercel selects its package manager from whichever lockfile is committed. A
# stray bun.lock or package-lock.json (easily created by a local `bunx`/`npx`)
# switches the build away from yarn, and a lockfile migrated from yarn v1 pins
# dependencies to tarball URLs that bun does not link binaries for — so
# `next build` fails with "next: command not found".
bun.lock
bun.lockb
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
